ですよ。\n疎らな配列かないかは for loop での方法しかないね。","ts":"1619772610.478600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t14"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d0b1ec3-0342-42e4-9edb-97e287694ce2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"JSのarray、罠多過ぎませんか","ts":"1619772585.478100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9qtK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc4071dd-6803-4999-85a6-bae04f15433d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あ、\n\u003chttps://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array/every\u003e\n\u0026gt; `callback` は値が代入されている配列の要素に対してのみ呼び出されます。つまり、すでに削除された要素や、まだ値が代入されていない要素に対しては呼び出されません。\nそもそも呼ばれないからだめそう","ts":"1619772492.476700","attachments":[{"fallback":"Array.prototype.every() - JavaScript | MDN","id":1,"title":"Array.prototype.every() - JavaScript | MDN","title_link":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array/every","text":"every() メソッドは、列内のすべての要素が指定された関数で実装されたテストに合格するかどうかをテストします。これは論理値を返します。","blocks":null,"service_name":"developer.mozilla.org","service_icon":"https://developer.mozilla.org/favicon144.png","from_url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array/every","original_url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array/every"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"283pU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a3d6754-7635-4896-bb98-8ed1b1534867","type":"message","user":"UNM8AVCB0","text":"`undefined == null` なので\n`x != null` ~ `x !== null \u0026amp;\u0026amp; x !== undefined`","ts":"1619772464.476300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GvZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8ba9546-33df-466a-8112-2e0021a96042","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"not nullでundefinedかのチェックは無理でしょうね","ts":"1619772390.475200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Mu01"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b600a0f-24a9-4d36-be4d-29e6bbe48e11","type":"message","user":"UNM8AVCB0","text":"疎らな配列かないか確認したいので `arr.every(x =\u0026gt; x != null)` を書いたけど","ts":"1619772361.474500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9eM8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8946215f-2fd5-45e2-9f3f-d515be99b870","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"へえ","ts":"1619772295.473800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cay"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e553719-9675-4e29-80c1-53e4153afe5b","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"まばらな","ts":"1619772293.473500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cCg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05f72bf7-2498-4392-93e7-49f7f41676f4","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"JSでemptyの明確な定義がないからか?\nまばら?","ts":"1619772290.473300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/ihp+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"827accbf-c070-4d0b-9ec7-a3eb6ef0bf15","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u0026gt; 疎らな配列\nなんて読むんだっけ………","ts":"1619772276.472700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SH0E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94bdf0b5-96f4-4aa1-9f14-39a3464da88e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"むしろ効率から自然な印象","ts":"1619772220.472200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z88"}]},{"client_msg_id":"899f76e9-3665-41e1-9c0c-1f4bca4130e4","type":"message","user":"UNM8AVCB0","text":"```const a = [ , , , 1] // [empty x 3, 1]\nconst b = [...a]     // [undefined, undefined, undefined, 1]\na.every(x =\u0026gt; x != null) // -\u0026gt; true\nb.every(x =\u0026gt; x != null) // -\u0026gt; false```","ts":"1619772202.471900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BqL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be9b57b8-21b7-4a0f-a22c-fd0f4b5cb343","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"仕様として、さっきにMDNから\n\u003chttps://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array/forEach\u003e\n\u0026gt; forEach() は、与えられた関数 callback を配列に含まれる各要素に対して一度ずつ、昇順で呼び出します。インデックスプロパティが削除されていたり、初期化されていなかったりした場合は呼び出されません。(疎らな配列については、下記の例を参照。)\nだそうで","ts":"1619772191.471600","attachments":[{"fallback":"Array.prototype.forEach() - JavaScript | MDN","id":1,"title":"Array.prototype.forEach() - JavaScript | MDN","title_link":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array/forEach","text":"forEach() メソッドは与えられた関数を、配列の各要素に対して一度ずつ実行します。","blocks":null,"service_name":"developer.mozilla.org","service_icon":"https://developer.mozilla.org/favicon144.e7e21ca2.png","from_url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array/forEach","original_url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array/forEach"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7DL2Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d278135-991b-484a-a4b7-3588855dda0c","type":"message","user":"UNM8AVCB0","text":"罠ですね。","ts":"1619772065.470100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"33mnX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb0a103f-8b64-4e69-bbe1-3ec52b642d72","type":"message","user":"UNM8AVCB0","text":"`for (const v of arr) {}`  は `for (let i = 0; i \u0026lt; arr.length; ++i) { const v = arr[i] ... }` と同じなので\n`string(i) in arr === false` でも処理されます。","ts":"1619772029.469900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FXM89"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d36c333f-d51f-45a4-9eea-61122923da79","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"自分も誤解したけど、まあ知見が増えた","ts":"1619771894.468200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bnJBB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed72a227-c2ec-492e-b2a5-9bd9a7bad465","type":"message","user":"UNM8AVCB0","text":"`'0' in [ , , , 1] === false` なので Array.forEach Array.some とかは対象外","ts":"1619771877.467800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dzo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c73db26a-dc92-49a6-beff-0077d46993e9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なら素直に0,1,2がundefinedだから、でいいのでは?","ts":"1619771868.467600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BcL6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"223c0238-4f75-4742-a5fe-c782c6a6037c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あ、なるほど...","ts":"1619771843.466800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SLu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39d5163c-9dd0-4a46-b821-423cca01165f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"前者は 0 として定義されてるか、後者は0というのは意味があるか(length=4だからある)じゃない?","ts":"1619771829.466500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BDiYD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d75ebd5b-c0e3-4fde-a480-8b2d6303bf1f","type":"message","user":"UNM8AVCB0","text":"`'0' in [ , , , 1] === false` です。すいません。","ts":"1619771829.466400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YN3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02d4a16b-f68c-44b7-92d1-1886ae4e49b0","type":"message","user":"UNM8AVCB0","text":"難しいい","ts":"1619771791.465500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JGMGA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57b46eca-83a0-4a4e-b